    <creator type="composer">Words: Thomas Hansen Kingo, 1689. Translated by Carl Døving, 1908.
Music: 'Au Meines Herzens Grunde' or 'I Døden Jesus Blunded' or 'Jeg Vil Din Pris Udsjunge', David Wolder, 1598.
Setting: "The Lutheran Hymnary", 1913.
copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.</creator>
